# CMMS Entities

## Purpose

Defines the business entities, their attributes, and relationships for Operix CMMS.

---

## Asset Category

| Column          | Type        | Required | Description                                  |
| --------------- | ----------- | -------- | -------------------------------------------- |
| id              | int         | Yes      | Primary key                                  |
| organization_id | int         | Yes      | Reference to Organization                    |
| name            | string(200) | Yes      | Asset category name                          |
| code            | string(50)  | Yes      | Unique category code within the organization |
| description     | string(500) | No       | Asset category description                   |
| is_active       | bool        | Yes      | Indicates whether the category is active     |

### Relationships

| Entity       | Type        |
| ------------ | ----------- |
| Organization | Many-to-One |
| Asset        | One-to-Many |

---

## Asset

| Column               | Type        | Required | Description                               |
| -------------------- | ----------- | -------- | ----------------------------------------- |
| id                   | int         | Yes      | Primary key                               |
| organization_id      | int         | Yes      | Reference to Organization                 |
| asset_category_id    | int         | Yes      | Reference to Asset Category               |
| location_id          | int         | Yes      | Reference to Location                     |
| name                 | string(200) | Yes      | Asset name                                |
| code                 | string(50)  | Yes      | Unique asset code within the organization |
| serial_number        | string(100) | No       | Manufacturer serial number                |
| manufacturer         | string(200) | No       | Manufacturer name                         |
| model                | string(200) | No       | Asset model                               |
| installation_date    | date        | No       | Installation date                         |
| purchase_date        | date        | No       | Purchase date                             |
| warranty_expiry_date | date        | No       | Warranty expiry date                      |
| status               | string(50)  | Yes      | Current asset status                      |
| is_active            | bool        | Yes      | Indicates whether the asset is active     |

### Relationships

| Entity         | Type        |
| -------------- | ----------- |
| Organization   | Many-to-One |
| Asset Category | Many-to-One |
| Location       | Many-to-One |
| Asset Document | One-to-Many |
| Work Order     | One-to-Many |

---

## Asset Document

| Column      | Type        | Required | Description                 |
| ----------- | ----------- | -------- | --------------------------- |
| id          | int         | Yes      | Primary key                 |
| asset_id    | int         | Yes      | Reference to Asset          |
| file_name   | string(255) | Yes      | Original file name          |
| file_path   | string(500) | Yes      | Storage path or URL         |
| file_type   | string(100) | Yes      | File MIME type or extension |
| file_size   | long        | Yes      | File size in bytes          |
| description | string(500) | No       | Document description        |

### Relationships

| Entity | Type        |
| ------ | ----------- |
| Asset  | Many-to-One |

