## Work Order

| Column                         | Type         | Required | Description                                      |
| ------------------------------ | ------------ | -------- | ------------------------------------------------ |
| id                             | int          | Yes      | Primary key                                      |
| organization_id                | int          | Yes      | Reference to Organization                        |
| asset_id                       | int          | Yes      | Reference to Asset                               |
| preventive_maintenance_plan_id | int          | No       | Reference to Preventive Maintenance Plan         |
| assigned_user_id               | int          | No       | Assigned technician                              |
| work_order_number              | string(50)   | Yes      | Unique work order number within the organization |
| title                          | string(200)  | Yes      | Work order title                                 |
| description                    | string(1000) | No       | Work order description                           |
| priority                       | string(50)   | Yes      | Work order priority                              |
| status                         | string(50)   | Yes      | Current work order status                        |
| scheduled_date                 | date         | No       | Scheduled execution date                         |
| due_date                       | date         | No       | Due date                                         |
| completed_date                 | date         | No       | Completion date                                  |
| is_active                      | bool         | Yes      | Indicates whether the work order is active       |

### Relationships

| Entity                      | Type        |
| --------------------------- | ----------- |
| Organization                | Many-to-One |
| Asset                       | Many-to-One |
| Preventive Maintenance Plan | Many-to-One |
| User                        | Many-to-One |
| Maintenance Schedule        | One-to-One  |
| Work Order Task             | One-to-Many |

